@DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5063

### Liveness and database reachability
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json

### Everything the dashboard landing page needs, in one call
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/summary
Accept: application/json

### KPI tiles: latest value, change since the previous release, change year over year
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/kpis?seriesIds=2,5
Accept: application/json

### Trend, bucket width chosen automatically from the range and the densest series
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/trend?seriesIds=2&from=2024-01-01&to=2025-12-31
Accept: application/json

### Trend, business-daily SOFR forced into monthly buckets (value is the mean; min/max carry the spread)
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/dashboard/trend?seriesIds=5&from=2024-01-01&to=2025-12-31&granularity=Month
Accept: application/json

### Publishers
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sources
Accept: application/json

### Categories, for drill-down. Flat; the hierarchy is in parentCategoryId
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Accept: application/json

### Series catalogue - active only, latest value attached
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series?dataSourceId=1&page=1&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Series search, over title and code
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series?search=seasonally
Accept: application/json

### One series
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series/2
Accept: application/json

### Observations: current values, in the series' own period length, oldest first
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series/2/observations?from=2024-01-01&to=2025-12-31
Accept: application/json

### Every vintage, including superseded ones
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series/2/observations?from=2025-01-01&includeRevisions=true
Accept: application/json

### Point-in-time: what we believed on 15 July 2026, ignoring anything learned since
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series/2/observations?from=2025-01-01&asOfUtc=2026-07-15T00:00:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Collection health per source, rolling 30-day window
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/collection/health
Accept: application/json

### Recent failures - the operations panel's default view
GET {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/collection/runs?failuresOnly=true&pageSize=20
Accept: application/json

### Rename a series. rowVersion comes from GET /api/series/2; omit it to skip the concurrency check
PUT {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/series/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "CPI-U, All items, US city average, seasonally adjusted",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "decimalPlaces": 3,
  "isActive": true,
  "rowVersion": "AAAAAAAAB9E="
}

### Create a category
POST {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "cpi-food",
  "displayName": "CPI - Food and beverages",
  "parentCategoryId": 1,
  "sortOrder": 15
}

### Pause a source without losing its history
PATCH {{DataIntelligence.Api_HostAddress}}/api/sources/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isEnabled": false
}

###
